{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is approached, take it and process it. Otherwise, approach object or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
